<title>USA: CCC buys 4,280 tonnes U.S. yellow corn for Angola.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 4,280 tonnes U.S. yellow corn for Angola.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 4,280 tonnes of U.S. No. 2 yellow corn under the export donation program to Angola.</p>
<p>The corn was acquired from Cargill Inc, Minneapolis, at $142.98 a tonne for October 5-31 shipment.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
